Data (data/, overlay/, reports/)

The OT Discussion and rationale text, control identifiers and baseline allocations in these files
are taken from NIST SP 800-82 Rev. 4 (initial public draft) and Rev. 3. NIST publications are works
of the United States Government and are not subject to copyright protection in the United States
(17 U.S.C. 105). The structure and additions made in this repository are dedicated to the public
domain under CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

vendor/nist-oscal-content/ holds unmodified copies of files from https://github.com/usnistgov/oscal-content,
which are distributed by NIST under its own terms (see that repository's LICENSE.md).
